	(text_box "LED spec is 2.1V forward voltage @ 10mA. However, the KSZ8081 maxes out at 8mA of LED drive, and the MCU is similar. So, we will shoot for 5mA and assume that the forward voltage will decrease to around 2.0V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 201.93 34.29 0)
		(size 38.1 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
